  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for the Employment Promotion through SMMEs Support Programme for the Republic of South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contract is to provide the full suite of technical assistance (TA) required for the effective implementation of the &apos;Employment Promotion through SMMEs Support Programme for South Africa&apos; during its operational implementation phase.  The TA will comprise a team of 4 key experts and a substantial pool of non-key experts to be mobilised as and when required.</narrative>
  </description>
